SUMMARY:First Friday Film: The Sheep Detectives
DESCRIPTION:The Sheep Detectives (2026)\nPG\, 1h 49m\n\nFeaturing: Hugh 
 Jackman\, Regina Hall\, Brett Goldstein\, Julia Louis-Dreyfus & many 
 more!\nDirected by: Kyle Balda\n\nEvery night a shepherd reads aloud a 
 murder mystery\, pretending his sheep can understand. When he is found 
 dead\, the sheep realize at once that it was a murder and think they know 
 everything about how to go about solving it. --IMDB\n\nBased on the novel 
 Three Bags Full\, the first of a hit mystery series by Leonie Swann
