SUMMARY:"The Ride" - Music and Storytelling from the American West
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by his lifelong love affair with the American West\, 
 Marc Berger\, a nationally touring artist\, performs songs from his album\, 
 "Ride." Join us for an evening showcase of ten cinematic songs capturing 
 the vastness and romance of the West while exploring its deep roots in the 
 American psyche. \n\nFrom the haunting message and beat of “Twister” 
 and the soul-shaking challenge of taming a wild horse in “Take it on the 
 Chin”\, to the sexy\, mind-blowing\, middle-of-nowhere encounter of 
 “Time Waits For No Man” and on through seven more scenic stops\, RIDE 
 takes you on a dusty tour of the Great American Frontier
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School
UID:LibCal-10306-17116972
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17116972
END:VEVENT
