 veterans.\n\nTeen Volunteers must be in grades 8 to 12.  Due to the limited 
 number of volunteer hours available we are only able to accommodate 
 students from the Caldwell/West Caldwell and West Essex school districts.  
 A volunteer application must be filled out and signed by a parent or 
 guardian and handed in at the first volunteer event you attend\, please 
 contact the teen librarian at sami.calderone@westcaldwell.bccls.org for an 
 application. \n\nRegistration is required.
