 e a variety of different formats\, focusing on concepts like cardio\, mus
 cular strength and endurance\, and flexibility.\nHow do I sign-up?\n\nNo 
 registration required.\nFREE for students with a valid Montclair State ID
 .\n\nWhere and when?\n\nTuesday and Sunday (8/31 through 12/6)\nTuesday: 
