SUMMARY:The Twilight Zone: Alternate Dimensions and Parallel Worlds
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nThe Twilight Zone is known to take its viewers to strange\, 
 new worlds. This season is no different with stories about recurring 
 dreams\, surreal dreamscapes\, co-existing twin strangers as well as alien 
 realms accessible through an unexpected portal or by way of intergalactic 
 space travel.\n\nDuring our interactive study of alternate dimensions and 
 parallel worlds\, we will be passengers on various journeys with reluctant 
 dreamers\, haunting doppelgangers and those who must escape an alternate 
 universe or who have a desire to travel back to the comfort of their place 
 on Earth. Join me as we take these unique\, unpredictable trips through The 
 Twilight Zone.\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Books, Film & Theater
UID:LibCal-10306-17960178
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17960178
END:VEVENT
