SUMMARY:Your Library\, Your Voice: Help Shape the New Library!
DESCRIPTION:What does the library mean to you? As we prepare for our 
 upcoming renovation\, we want to build a space that truly serves our 
 community—and that starts with listening to you.\n\nJoin us for an open 
 feedback session to share whatever is on your mind:\n\n\n	\n	How you use 
 the library today\n	\n	\n	What you love about our programs\, collections\, 
 and spaces\n	\n	\n	Frustrations or obstacles you've run into\n	\n	\n	What 
 you’d love to see in the renovated space\n	\n\n\nWhether you have big 
 design ideas or just want to tell us about your favorite books\, we're all 
 ears. Your feedback will directly guide the design\, programs\, and future 
 of our library.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Tower Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Meeting
UID:LibCal-10306-17959445
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17959445
