DESCRIPTION:Join the Linguistics and SLP & Audiology club as they host an 
 alumni panel of Montclair Graduates from the Communication Sciences and D
 isorders program! They'll be offering insight into their jobs\, what they
  do\, and any tips they have for undergraduate students. We welcome every
 one who wants to know more about the Speech Language Pathology & Audiolog
 y world! Snacks are provided\, RSVP NECESSARY\, in person and zoom option
