X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ics Kstx8Swyw669Kakgqa 6478083 Ics": "https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2144131246"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ics_kstx8swyw669kakgqa_6478083_ics
SUMMARY:Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narratives\, Pa
 rt II
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T180000
DTSTAMP:20261107T030315Z
UID:TU2144131246
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T160000
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260804T175205Z
DESCRIPTION:**Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narrative
 s\, Part II**  \nA Learning Series led by Rabbi Justus Baird    \n  \nA 
 three-part series exploring dual narratives of events in Israel/Palestine\
 , specifically from Israeli Jewish and Palestinian points of view. The goa
 l of the series is not to debate those narratives nor change our own\, but
  simply to hear and engage with them.  \n  \nIn this session\, we will foc
 us on narratives of the early Zionist movement and Jewish immigration\, up
  to and including the Balfour Declaration and its impact (1880s - 1920). 
   \n  \nAdvance reading\, approximately two book chapters\, is required. P
 lease register so that Rabbi Justus can share pre-reading materials with y
 ou before the class.     \n  \n**Registration**: https://shomrei.easysh
 ul.com/events/6ac90befe0b01c00261147e5  \n  \nParticipants should expect t
 he learning to be challenging and difficult\, emotionally and psychologica
 lly.  \n  \nThis session is open to all\, whether you attended Part I of t
 he series or not.   \n  \nThe first session\, on May 17\, covered the es
 tablishment of the State of Israel\, what Palestinians call the Naqba. The
  third and final session\, scheduled for January 10\, will explore the Fir
 st Intifada.  \n  \nPlease remember to bring your fob to access the buildi
 ng.  \n  \n**Questions?**  \nContact the Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.
 org  \n(973) 746-5031\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261106T211323Z
LOCATION:Congregation Shomrei Emunah\, 67 Park St\, Montclair\, NJ 07042\,
  USA\, Social Hall
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL;VALUE=URI:https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2144131246
X-SOURCE:Congregation Shomrei Emunah
X-TEAMUP-ROOM:Congregation Shomrei Emunah\, 67 Park St\, Montclair\, NJ 07
 042\, USA\, Social Hall
END:VEVENT
