SUMMARY:Learn English Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Come expand your English vocabulary through great books! 
 Learning another language also means using that language. This is a great 
 way to read\, discuss books and learn in a safe friendly environment. Must 
 be a second language learner (English is not your first language) who is a 
 fairly proficient speaker. If you’re not sure but interested sign up and 
 take a chance!\n\nClass Booklist:\n10/05 Grace Period by Maria Judith De 
 Carvalho\n10/19 Pew by Catherine Lacey\n10/26 Catalina by Karla Cornejo 
 Villavicencio\n11/02 The Berry Pickers by Amanda Peters\n11/09 
 Nightcrawling by Leila Mottley\n11/16 Heavy by Kiese Laymon\n11/23 A Man 
 Called Ove by Fredrick Backman\n\nClass will not meet on October 12.\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Tower Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Language, Book Club
UID:LibCal-10306-17131380
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17131380
