DESCRIPTION:Get ready to rock for a cause that matters! Join us for our th
 ird annual Rock to Fight Alzheimer’s fundraising concert on November 21\
 , 2026\, from 1:30 to 6:00 PM at The Proving Ground. Bringing together ove
 r 200 attendees and featuring some of New Jersey’s favorite shore bands\
 , our event combines great live music\, community spirit\, and fundraising
  to make a meaningful difference for local families affected by Alzheimer
 ’s disease and other forms of dementia. Alzheimer’s New Jersey® is a 
 local nonprofit dedicated to supporting New Jersey families affected by Al
 zheimer’s. Through programs such as our Respite Care and Wellness progra
 m\, support groups\, and Helpline\, we provide families and caregivers wit
 h essential resources\, guidance\, and support as they face this devastati
 ng disease. Guests will enjoy an afternoon of music and fun while particip
 ating in our tricky tray raffle\, 50/50 raffle\, and door prize giveaways.
  One hundred percent of funds raised will benefit New Jersey families affe
