SUMMARY:Keys to the Holidays: A Piano Morning with Anthony Ramm
DESCRIPTION:Kick off your holiday season with the sound of live piano 
 music! 🎹 Join us at the West Caldwell Public Library for a special 
 morning performance by local student pianist Anthony Ramm\, who will fill 
 the library with festive holiday favorites.\n\nAfter two well-received 
 local performances\, Anthony is bringing his musical talents to the library 
 for a morning of seasonal music and community spirit. Stop by\, settle in\, 
 and enjoy a little holiday cheer!\n\nDate: Saturday\, December 12\nTime: 
 9:30–11:00 AM\nLocation: West Caldwell Public Library\n\nAll are welcome!
