SUMMARY:Romance Book Club: Good Spirits
DESCRIPTION:GOOD SPIRITS\nby B.K. Borison (2025)\n\nNolan Callahan haunts 
 Harriet York\, who's not exactly Scrooge\, but as she and Nolan begin to 
 examine her past\, they discover threads that bind them together -- and 
 realize there might be more to moving on than expected. --EBSCO 
 NoveList\n\n
LOCATION:Literacy Room\, West Orange Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
