SUMMARY:Library Chef: Winter Superfoods Made Simple
DESCRIPTION:Cut through the hype and discover what "superfoods" really 
 mean! This session breaks down simple\, affordable\, nutrient rich 
 ingredients you can actually use in everyday meals to power your health all 
 winter long. Real kitchen skills\, no complicated recipes or expensive 
 trends.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
