 d with writing theTao Te Ching. Tai Chi is a form of moving meditation des
 igned to improve balance\, mobility\, and relaxation.TNT members Ray Wolfs
 on and Irene Sherman lead this group\, bringing more than 20 years of dedi
 cated learning and practice to their teaching. Both are passionate Tai Chi
  p
