 aturdays. Each session will be host to a different garden or nature inspir
 ed activity such as\, “adopting” a tree\, creating and adding to a com
 munity art project\, seasonal scavenger hunts\, finding art in nature\, bi
 rd watching\, and more! Programming is designed for ages 5 and up\, but al
 l are welcome!Please Note: This is a drop-in program but not a drop-off pr
 ogram. P
