SUMMARY:Cricut - Mini Book Ornaments
DESCRIPTION:\n\nBack by popular demand\, we are making Book Ornaments -- 
 tiny versions of books\, inside a clear plastic ornament.\n\nWe'll use 
 cardstock cut on the Cricut machine as well as photos of book covers to 
 showcase your chosen books.\n\nMake a list of your "Books Read in 2026\," 
 your favorites of all time\, or whatever you like!  It would also make a 
 nice gift! \n\nAbout 10-15 books fit nicely in the ornament and still let 
 you see all the covers.\n\n*You MUST submit a list of your top 10-15 books 
 ASAP upon registration -- if possible\, before 12/11\, but definitely by 
 12/16 at the LATEST.  We will be printing out sheets of book covers for you 
 to use\, and it takes time to find the graphics and resize them.  If you do 
 not submit a list of books you may not be able to participate.*\n\nOnce you 
 are registered\, please send your list to marisa.treglio@nutley.bccls.org 
 and put "Book Ornaments" in the subject line.  Alternatively\, drop off 
 your list at the reference desk -- make sure your name is on it!\n\nAll 
 supplies provided.  No Cricut machine or experience necessary.\n\nOnline 
 registration is required and limited to 20 Nutley adults.  ONLY REGISTER 
 FOR ONE SESSION!\n\n \n\n
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Craft
UID:LibCal-10315-17935055
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17935055
END:VEVENT
