SUMMARY:Noon Year's Eve celebration for children and their grownups
DESCRIPTION:🎉 Ring in the New Year with us at the library! 🎉\n\nJoin 
 us for a morning of fun\, laughter\, and celebration at the Bloomfield 
 Public Library! Children and their grownups are invited to enjoy festive 
 read-alouds\, tasty snacks\, balloon activities\, special guests\, and 
 music by DJ Corey. We'll wrap up the excitement with a special countdown to 
 12 noon!\n\n📅 December 31st\n⏰ 11:00 AM – 12:30 PM\n📍 Bloomfield 
 Public Library\n\nBring the whole family and celebrate the New Year with 
 us! 🥳🎈
LOCATION:Bloomfield - Quiet Study\, Bloomfield Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomfield Library":MAILTO:reference@bloomfield.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10270-17958230
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17958230
END:VEVENT
