DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, December 31 \n\n11:00 AM to 12:00 PM (Ball Drop at 
 12:00 PM)\n\nCan't make it to midnight? No problem!\n\nJoin us for music\, 
 dancing and a craft as we ring in the New Year at noon! \n\nDress to 
 impress! \n\nFor all ages.\n\nNo registration required.\n\nFor more 
 information\, visit nutleypubliclibrary.org or call 973-667-0405 ext. 2623.
