SUMMARY:Library Speakers Consortium - Middle School Mayhem and Laugh-Out-Loud Misadventures with Jeff Kinney
DESCRIPTION:You must register here to attend: 
 https://libraryc.org/nutleypubliclibrary/229622\n\n\n\nJoin us online for a 
 hilarious\, action-packed virtual conversation with #1 international 
 bestselling author Jeff Kinney as he introduces the 21st book in his 
 globally beloved series\, Diary of a Wimpy Kid: Fight or Flight. \n\nGreg 
 Heffley is about to learn that surviving middle school is no easy 
 feat.\n\nIn Fight or Flight\, Greg’s hard-earned expertise on navigating 
 the rough-and-tumble world of middle school is put to the test.\n\nWhen a 
 secret binder filled with Greg’s notes on the school’s biggest bullies 
 falls into the wrong hands\, his world quickly begins to unravel. Now 
 it’s a race against time before the truth comes out. Will Greg throw in 
 the towel—or go down swinging?\n\nComplete with Kinney's signature comic 
 illustrations and sharp\, laugh-out-loud humor\, this latest installment 
 captures the awkward\, unpredictable realities of growing up that have made 
 Greg Heffley an icon for generations of readers.\n\nRegister today to gain 
 exclusive\, behind-the-scenes access to Jeff Kinney’s creative universe! 
 \n\nAbout the Author: \n\nJeff Kinney is a #1 New York Times bestselling 
 author\, a six-time Nickelodeon Kids' Choice Award winner for Favorite 
 Book\, and one of Time magazine's 100 Most Influential People in the World. 
 He spent his childhood in the Washington\, D.C.\, area and later moved to 
 Massachusetts\, where he and his family own a bookstore called An Unlikely 
 Story.\n\n\n\n
LOCATION:Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Author Event/Talk
