X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ics Kstx8Swyw669Kakgqa 6478083 Ics": "https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2182219754"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ics_kstx8swyw669kakgqa_6478083_ics
SUMMARY:Talk\, Teach\, Empower: Strategies for Addressing Antisemitism wit
 h Children 
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270128T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270128T203000
DTSTAMP:20261107T030315Z
UID:TU2182219754
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20270128T190000
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261006T142600Z
DESCRIPTION:  \nTalk\, Teach\, Empower: Strategies for Addressing Antisemi
 tism with Children   \n\nHow can we instill Jewish joy and pride in our c
 hildren\, while supporting them and ourselves\, as antisemitism increasing
 ly surfaces in our local schools and neighborhoods?\n\nJoin fellow parents
 /guardians of young children (ages 5-12) to learn with Rabbi Diana Fersko\
 , nationally recognized author of **We Need to Talk About Antisemitism**\,
  for this practical workshop covering how to show up as a parent raising J
 ewish children in a world of antisemitism: focusing on safety\, Jewish pri
 de\, questions\, awareness and more.\n\nThis workshop is intended for pare
 nts/guardians of all backgrounds\, including interfaith\\* families.\n\n  
 \n**Open to:**  \nEveryone\, Visitors and Guests Welcome  \n  \n**RSVP Req
 uired**  \n  \nAdd for events at Shomrei - **Members should bring their f
 obs to enter the building.**   \n  \n  \n**Questions?** Contact the Shomr
 ei Office  \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(973) 746-5031 ext. 0\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T192037Z
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL;VALUE=URI:https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2182219754
X-SOURCE:Congregation Shomrei Emunah
END:VEVENT
